Package: recoverome
Title: Infrastructure for Longitudinal Microbiome Recovery Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Francesc",
           family = "Catala-Moll",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
Description: Establishes the package infrastructure and documented design for
    longitudinal microbiome recovery analysis. Defines conventions for working
    with 'TreeSummarizedExperiment' objects, sample annotations, and named
    analysis records. Includes an introductory container example and development
    documentation; analytical recovery methods are not implemented in this
    initial experimental release.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/xec-cm/recoverome,
    https://xec-cm.github.io/recoverome/
